  m_text: "<color=#ffe07a>Di chuy\u1EC3n</color>\n  Chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i (b\u1EA5m ho\u1EB7c gi\u1EEF), ho\u1EB7c ph\xEDm m\u0169i t\xEAn\n\n<color=#ffe07a>T\u1EA5n c\xF4ng</color>\n  Chu\u1ED9t tr\xE1i: b\u1EA5m v\xE0o qu\xE1i \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EDBi \u0111\xE1nh,\n  gi\u1EEF \u0111\u1EC3 ch\xE9m v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa chu\u1ED9t \xB7 Q: Ch\xE9m Gi\xF3\n\n<color=#ffe07a>K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng</color>\n  Q W E R A S D: k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng c\u1EE7a l\u1EDBp nh\xE2n v\u1EADt\n  (di chu\u1ED9t l\xEAn \xF4 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1EC3 xem)\n  Space: L\u01B0\u1EDBt (b\u1EA5t t\u1EED trong ch\u1ED1c l\xE1t)\n\n<color=#ffe07a>B\xECnh thu\u1ED1c</color>\n  1 M\xE1u \xB7 2 N\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng \xB7 3 Th\u1EA3o m\u1ED9c"
